<header class="ref-head cen-head"><p class="cty-kicker">History by century · The years 1–99</p><h1 class="research-title">The 1st century</h1><p class="ref-lede">In the years 1–99, 186 recorded states existed somewhere in the world. 33 were founded and 55 came to an end. The great powers of the age included the Roman Empire, the Han Dynasty and the Parthian Empire.</p></header>
